❌ Error Faced

permission denied (failed to create child token)

🧠 Root Cause

Policy only allowed reading secrets

❌ Missing permission to create token

✅ Fix

Added permission
✔ Reapplied policy
✔ Regenerated secret_id
✔ Re-ran Terraform

🔑 Key Learnings

✔ Never hardcode secrets
✔ Vault secures sensitive data
✔ Policies control access
✔ AppRole enables automation
✔ Terraform requires token creation permission
✔ Proper policy = successful authentication

💡 Final Insight

Terraform is not just provisioning, it’s about secure infrastructure management using external secrets.